
# Follow docs/COMMIT_MESSAGES.md, the authoritative commit-message standard.
# This template summarizes that guide; it adds no separate restrictions.
#
# type(scope)!: description
#
# Type, colon-space, and description are required; scope and ! are optional.
# Use fix for fixes, feat for features, or another appropriate noun type.
# No fixed type list, subject case, terminal period, or length is required.
#
# Optional body and footers follow, separated by blank lines.
# Mark breaking changes with !, a BREAKING CHANGE: footer, or both.
# Explain a breaking change in the header when using ! without a footer.
#
# For substantial AI assistance, describe the contribution and verification
# in the body and add an Assisted-by: trailer; see the guide for details.
